  "title": "Accel Entertainment, Inc. to Report First Quarter 2026 Results, Host Conference Call and Webcast on May 5",
  "summary": "Accel Entertainment, Inc. (NYSE: ACEL) (“Accel” or “the Company”), a leading locals-focused gaming operator partnering with small businesses, local communities, and state governments to provide entertaining, convenient, and safe gaming experiences nationwide, announced today it will release its financial and operating results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, after market close on Tuesday, May 5, 2026. The Company will host a conference call and webcast that day at 4:30 PM ET / 3:30 PM",
